"gloss":"army"},{"surface":"வேந்தர்","parts":[{"text":"வேந்தர்","lemma":"வேந்தர்","gloss":"kings"}],"gloss":"kings"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொலம்","parts":[{"text":"பொலம்","lemma":"பொலம்","gloss":"gold"}],"gloss":"gold"},{"surface":"படை","parts":[{"text":"படை","lemma":"படை","gloss":"harness/ornaments"}],"gloss":"harnessed"},{"surface":"கலி","parts":[{"text":"கலி","lemma":"கலி","gloss":"spirited"}],"gloss":"spirited"},{"surface":"மா","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"மா","gloss":"horse"}],"gloss":"horses"},{"surface":"எண்ணுவோரே","parts":[{"text":"எண்ணு","lemma":"எண்ணு","gloss":"count"},{"text":"வோர்","lemma":"வோர்","gloss":"those who"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"are those who count"}]}],"literal":"Sweet water's deep pool blossomed water-lily's / bud-opened full-petaled rolling-down waist / eminent beauty cool eyes sweet smile women / dry grass swarming forked-paths thorny woven fence / cotton front-yard small house there / sponge-gourd smelling bottle-gourd climbing side / date-palm leaf heap climbing salt-merchants / salt carrying caravan count indeed / I grieve indeed! May it fade, the morning! / frequented dark mountain-slope buck leaping and playing / even the bucks not containing, many / season even when not, trees yield offer / new wealth unceasing wide mountain like that / lordly tall mountain climbing, father / abundant liquor sharp spear Pāri's / greatness not knowing, war opposing came / victory-possessing army kings / golden-harnessed spirited horses count.","translation":"In the small houses with cotton-strewn front yards, surrounded by woven thorny fences along dry, swarming, forked paths where sponge-gourd and bottle-gourd climb, women with sweet smiles, cool eyes of eminent beauty, and waists where full-petaled, open-budded water-lilies from deep, sweet-water pools roll down, now climb the heaps of date-palm leaves to count the salt-merchants' caravans. I grieve indeed! May the morning hours fade! Once, we climbed the lordly tall mountain with our father, the sharp-speared Pāri of abundant liquor, whose wide mountain was unceasing in its rich fertility, where trees yielded fruit out of season, and where bucks leaped and played on the frequented dark slopes—so many that even the slopes could not hold them. Those kings of victorious armies who came opposing him in war, not knowing his greatness, are now those who count their golden-harnessed, spirited horses.","modern":"இனிய நீரையுடைய ஆழமான சுனையில் மலர்ந்த குவளை மலரின் இதழ்கள் புரளும் அல்குலையும், குளிர்ந்த கண்களையும், இனிய புன்னகையையும் உடைய மகளிர், பருத்தி உலரும் முற்றத்தைக் கொண்ட சிறிய குடிலில், பீர்க்கும் சுரையும் படர்ந்த பக்கத்தே, ஈச்ச இலையாலான குப்பையின் மேல் ஏறி, உமணர் ஓட்டிச் செல்லும் உப்பு வண்டிகளை எண்ணுகின்றனர். ஐயோ, நான் வருந்துகிறேன்! விடியற்காலம் அழியட்டும்! அடர்ந்த கரிய மலையடுக்கில் ஆண் மான்கள் துள்ளி விளையாட, மரங்கள் காலம் அல்லாத காலத்திலும் கனிகளைத் தரும் வளம் குறையாத பரம்பு மலையில், எம் தந்தை பாரியோடு உயர்ந்த மலையில் ஏறி நின்றோம். அவனது அருமையை அறியாமல் போரிட வந்த வெற்றி பொருந்திய சேனைகளையுடைய வேந்தர்கள், அன்று அவனது மலையை முற்றுகையிட்டுத் தங்கள் குதிரைகளை எண்ணிக் கொண்டிருந்தனர்.","explanation":"This poem is a poignant 'kaiyaṟunilai' (lament on death) composed by the poet Kapilar after the tragic death of the generous patron Vēḷ Pāri. It contrasts the glorious past of Pāri's daughters on the fertile Parampu mountain with their current impoverished state. Once, they climbed the high peaks with their father, looking down upon a mountain so rich that trees bore fruit out of season and wild bucks roamed in abundance, while enemy kings could only stand below and count their horses in a futile siege. Now, living in a humble hut with a thorny fence, they climb heaps of dry date-palm leaves just to pass the time by counting passing salt-merchants' carts. The imagery of the water-lily rolling on their waists highlights their noble beauty, now juxtaposed against their desolate, impoverished surroundings. Key words include 'பாரியது' (Pāri's), 'தந்தை' (father), 'நோகோ' (I grieve), and 'எண்ணுப' (they count).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}